silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_01_answerability_profile_sections_03_epistemology_reader_entry_yoneda_hom_leg_5 silm:hasExample "In 'P07AnswerabilityProfileEpistemologyReaderEntryYonedaHomLeg5', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, Patient is the role Mittens occupies in VetClinic_Osei: a role-assignment arrow into D_Mittens distinguishing the role from the cat." .
